{"id":778257,"title":"03｜构建你的第一条prompt","content":"本节课程探讨了如何有效利用AI工具如GPT和Kimi进行内容生成与问题解答。首先，通过一个关于炖鸡的对话案例展示了清晰提问的重要性：明确需求、提供背景信息能帮助AI给出更具体的建议。接着，介绍了提高AI回答质量的关键因素：问题拆解，将复杂问题分解为子问题逐步解决；设置回答范围，限定答案长度以获得精炼回复；选择合适的提示方式，根据问题类型调整提问策略；保持批判性思维，对AI提供的信息持审慎态度。这些方法不仅适用于AI交互，在处理网络信息时同样重要。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":407681,"user_name":"tiger1024","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3887253,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"17C20F5B3411AF","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/5SfML6aBDsvFaBbtZiazkClT1bArevOt3Ur1NaLqS1xdU2ZPMWofEUQ1Pe8PpTia4FLNw801LhDkFS6cXdnvv5rg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1779096739,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767801,"comment_content":"提高回答质量的关键因素：问题拆解、设置回答范围、针对问题对症下药、批判性思维","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":405719,"user_name":"浩然","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4476872,"ip_address":"山东","ucode":"C1AA722F8915FD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/44/4f/c8/f0e307c3.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1772679973,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767801,"comment_content":"你好老师，有配套学习的课件吗","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":397492,"user_name":"Geek_01aee0","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4058546,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"A5D30B4C2159F2","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738743771,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767801,"comment_content":"就是加定语的感觉 限定一下范围","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":393936,"user_name":"David","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2250504,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"199681942BF718","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/22/57/08/58bac698.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1725379789,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767801